{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0194_1000_p", "source_sha256": "afb80a31999e701591148a627d78e35b32c1c89470ffd27edcc280390de09c84", "ja": "（今日はアイドルが頻繁に使う老舗会場でのライブ。\n亜利沙は会場中を巻き込んで、大いに盛り上げた！）", "zh": "（今天是在偶像们经常使用的老牌会场举办的演唱会。亚利沙带动了全场气氛，让大家尽情嗨了起来！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0194_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "91ac408045868dee74f790b2831e5c97dce1e3f45a005b7f37d043490fab6d38", "ja": "うう……{$P$}ざん、\nおづがれざまですぅ……。", "zh": "呜呜……{$P$}先生，\n您辛苦了呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0194_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0e529ef774e06604fdad30a8fd370c7f68154d55b2aad845ebcb3dfed68e1448", "ja": "あれ？　亜利沙どうしたんだ？\nいいライブだったと思うけど、何か失敗したのか？", "zh": "咦？亚利沙你怎么了？\n我觉得是一场很棒的演出啊，是出了什么纰漏吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0194_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "2c30b35fa062e747b67894d4d43e5f4ad659b3ec1709a467353a6ca14f2e6209", "ja": "ぐすっ……違うんです。実はこの会場、\nありさが小さいころ、パパと来たことがあって……。", "zh": "呜……不是这样的。其实，这个会场，亚利沙小时候曾和爸爸一起来过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0194_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "134d339d6dc18aff8e14bc78f561147101c22cbc2734f81fe92eedf7253fe58b", "ja": "その時のアイドルちゃんのステージを見て、\nありさもあんなふうになりたい……って思ったんです。", "zh": "看到当时偶像们的舞台后，亚利沙也想成为那样的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0194_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6b187717d949d2d64b2021e380cfff285aa3c0cc65baf818e9dee311262819b5", "ja": "そうだったのか。", "zh": "原来是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0194_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "88d1725da5fb4b09901ec1e5bab6501c96230180b76755a6cc28e6fd939bb53c", "ja": "そんな思い出の場所で、歌える日が来るなんて……\nありさ、感無量です～っ！", "zh": "没想到竟然能有一天在这样充满回忆的地方唱歌……\n亚利沙真是感慨万千～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0194_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "11338d19341876c78f3a521ae9d198414d79b55e361e65010835fa3fec1dfad8", "ja": "アイドルとして思い残すコトは……ありますけど、\nでも、今倒れたとしても、悔いはありません！", "zh": "作为偶像，还有些未完成的事……确实有，不过，就算现在倒下，我也没有遗憾了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0194_1008_p", "source_sha256": "203acc4a0bf325ff40ff50d8bd6ea68c910799dfcf9b384cc7e39f43790cda3f", "ja": "悔いはなくても倒れるんじゃないぞ？\nけど、この場所にそんな思い出があったんだな。", "zh": "就算没有遗憾也不许倒下啊？\n不过，原来你对这个地方还有这样的回忆啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0194_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "a1dace88ef3eb461c4a39e3f023076ac7c0f67a5701d3a05c4edcf3cd870d82b", "ja": "はい！　あの時ありさは、初めてアイドルちゃんに\n出会ったんです。尊い光に包まれたといいますか……。", "zh": "是的！那时的有纱，第一次遇见了偶像们。可以说是被神圣的光芒包围了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0194_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "ac2548fe11669b17f201a8de63d2b67acabc9d3f4ede9f07bf1e7602a61faec3", "ja": "周りが、世界が全部、キラメキになったんです。音も\n空気も全部！　それでありさは、ありさは……！", "zh": "周围的一切、整个世界，全都变得闪闪发光。连声音\n和空气也是！然后亚利沙就、亚利沙就……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0194_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "1c308a7eb6b3e8a695f0c2571160d7c60674cb7c31eb3e55d462e7395c6fe562", "ja": "アイドルちゃんこそがあのキラメキを生むのだと気づき\nアイドルちゃんファンになったのでした！　ムフフ♪", "zh": "意识到正是偶像们创造了那份闪耀，\n于是就成了偶像们的粉丝！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0194_1012_p", "source_sha256": "54f7894418e91171be13f38bdbe68863765b3533a6b2da0bfd4446ee0d555a38", "ja": "なるほど……。じゃあ今回のライブで、\n亜利沙もそのキラメキを誰かに届けられたかもな。", "zh": "原来如此……那么这次的演出中，亚利沙或许也把那份闪耀传递给某个人了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0194_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "e37ca4b4294f580a8a2d25c5785c64c96dfa7923164c71d4678d78ade5972234", "ja": "あ、ありさがそんな大役を！？\nそんな、ありえないです！　だって、ありさですよ？", "zh": "啊，亚利沙居然担任了这么重要的角色！？\n不可能不可能！毕竟是亚利沙嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0194_1014_p", "source_sha256": "38e3b77d052e776407d8a84b15720da33f7f5b2c8f68012e8cb13badae49a2e2", "ja": "うん、亜利沙だよ。今日のライブを\n最高に盛り上げた、アイドルの松田亜利沙だ。", "zh": "嗯，是亚利沙哦。是让今天的演唱会气氛达到最高潮的偶像松田亚利沙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0194_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "8eb80eee2409ee0f15492996d5834d1972eddb43a316e7d2eb28053566a61644", "ja": "うっ……。あ、あの～、ホントに盛り上がってました？\nありさ必死だったので、よくわからないんですケド……", "zh": "呜……那、那个～，现场真的很热烈吗？\n亚利沙拼尽了全力，所以不太清楚呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0194_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d9d8823144ca0a15eb869b99129cd5e6d439470a2aafee08c9a617bc6f263213", "ja": "すごく盛り上がってたよ！　お客さん達の笑顔、\n亜利沙も目の前で見ただろ？", "zh": "现场气氛非常热烈哦！客人们的笑容，亜利沙你也亲眼看到了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0194_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "565bb2ba59d52030c28da235be3ca60de79a9993b82a61f17ff58870d79a4f12", "ja": "……はっ。\nえっと、じゃあ、あの……もしかして……。", "zh": "……啊。\n那个，那么，呃……难道说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0194_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "a8fc46aadb02b473c045568f8edd960cbf6f3d0971858d0ae330de151bec3910", "ja": "もしかしたら本当に、ひとりくらいは、\nそんな人がいるんでしょうか……？", "zh": "难道真的会有那么一个人……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0194_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f685521008b058e84b177a8d716aeea869e9fdaec8c409ad39fad1f4850870b1", "ja": "それは間違いない。\nとりあえず、ここにも一人いるから。", "zh": "那是肯定的。\n至少，这里就有一个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0194_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "a81c05d6389961d0309fafd2692d88437ce233130ab34e31cde60868e99e0496", "ja": "えっ、{$P$}さんが！？\nそ、そうですか……。あ、ありがとうございますっ。", "zh": "诶，{$P$}先生居然！？\n是、是这样啊……啊，非常感谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0194_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "713b22a1e7a5172d723fb46aafc045cb636f9be28faa70d682f4dc0e73915dea", "ja": "あ、あのっ。そんな、キセキみたいなコト、\nまだしっくりこないんですけど……。", "zh": "啊、那个……像这样奇迹般的事情，我还、还没什么实感……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0194_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "ba1e202b50ffd4c726b71de23fd86935cff14d3fcb018113f8b422943ae17a6f", "ja": "でも……もし今日のありさが、\nちゃんとキラメキを届けられていたのなら……。", "zh": "但是……如果今天的亚利沙，确实把闪耀传达给大家了的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0194_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "6db22ef7a83cd73e5303b793bd9fb9aa0ec074cda4c6a41503468060d0c2f97c", "ja": "ありさは、アイドルちゃんの素晴らしさをもっと世に\n広めるために、これからも頑張らなくちゃですねっ！", "zh": "亚利沙今后也必须继续努力，\n好让更多人领略到偶像的美妙之处呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0194_1024_p", "source_sha256": "ef19daa50796cd82a7fdfafde2c04b1a7f22592ee6ad56feec2eac405eb98c14", "ja": "うん、そうだな！\nそのためにも……。", "zh": "嗯，说得没错！为此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0194_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "746e54c41c3c2820d4a931e62759e8e7cbed6688465d90c298ba6c5c943b6c13", "ja": "はい！　倒れてるヒマはありませんっ！　これからも\nありさのプロデュース、よろしくお願いしますね！", "zh": "没错！现在可没时间倒下！今后也请继续负责亚利沙的制作哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
